00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:57,820
The problem is like this article here,

00:04:57,820 --> 00:05:00,100
this is from May 2019.

00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:06,580
This Dr. Professor of Medicine at Oregon Health Science University

00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:08,300
stated that the cost of care,

00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:12,180
the cost of the drug itself is over $475,000

00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:14,540
for a year use of this.

00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:18,420
And then it could cost a hospital $1.5 million

00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:20,780
and that's in an uncomplicated case.

00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:23,940
It could be well over $200 or $2 million.

00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:27,260
It treats somebody with CAR T cell therapy.

00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,540
So insurance companies are just balkyred at it

00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,980
and not approving it.

00:05:31,980 --> 00:05:36,220
So it's going to be very difficult for the cost of that care

00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:39,820
where going and doing chemotherapy,

00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:43,740
even long extended several years of chemotherapy

00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:46,540
can still be under a million dollars.

00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:49,420
This is going to be well over a million dollars

00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,740
